**Date:** March 25, 2023  

Dear Team,

I have completed the draft protocol for the clinical trial assessing the MediWear 3000's effectiveness in managing chronic conditions. Key features include:

- **Study Design**: Randomized controlled trial with a sample size of 300 participants, divided into a control group and an intervention group using the MediWear 3000.
- **Endpoints**: Primary endpoints will focus on hospital admissions due to uncontrolled hypertension and diabetes; secondary endpoints will assess patient satisfaction and device usability.
- **Duration**: The trial is projected to last six months post-enrollment.

I would like to schedule a review meeting on April 1, 2023, to discuss the protocol in detail and finalize any adjustments before we submit it to the IRB.

Thank you all for your valuable contributions to this initiative.

